{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00784","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆休 · 赵光逢、张衮","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆休","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大业来四夷，仁风和万国。\n白日体无私，皇天辅有德。\n七旬罪已服，六月师方克。\n伟哉帝道隆，终始常作则。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光逢、张衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}